msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ami「Awww...... I wish I could ride this ferris＿wheel with you forever, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ayyy...... Ojalá pudiera estar en esta＿rueda contigo para siempre, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't say things you don't really mean.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No digas cosas que no sientes de verdad.」"

msgid "Ami「You're horrible! I really did mean that.＿If we stay here, we can be together for＿eternity, you know.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Qué cruel eres! Lo decía en serio. Si＿nos quedamos aquí, podremos estar juntos＿por toda la eternidad, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It would get boring after a few hours.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tras unas horas sería aburrido.」"

msgid "Ami「Don't worry, I'd keep you entertained,＿Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Ami「No te preocupes, yo te mantendría＿entretenido, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I didn't mean me. You'd get bored,＿wouldn't you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No hablaba de mí. Tú te aburrirías,＿¿no es así?」"

msgid "Ami「I definitely wouldn't get bored. Just＿looking at your face make me happy,＿Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Ami「Seguro que no me aburriría.＿Con solo mirar tu cara ya me＿pongo feliz, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu, until we have to get off, I'll keep＿staaaring at your face, Ryuuji～①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju, hasta que tengamos que bajar, me＿quedaré mirááándote la cara, Ryuuji～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Stop it. No matter what you say, I'd＿feel awkward being stared at!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Para ya. ¡Digas lo que digas,＿me incomoda que me miren fijo!」"

msgid "Ami「It's fine ① This is just, like, how we are＿together.」"
msgstr "Ami「Está bien ① O sea, así somos＿cuando estamos juntos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're a strange girl, Kawashima.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Eres una chica rara, Kawashima.」"

msgid "Ami「Grrr～ Didn't I tell you to call me＿Ami-chan～?」"
msgstr "Ami「Grrr～ ¿No te dije que me＿llamaras Ami-chan～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, that's true...... err, Ami-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, es cierto...... eh, Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu, now then, I'll observe you＿carefully①」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju, entonces, te observaré＿con mucha atención①」"
